Yes, brothers and sisters, here we have come out, we will go
to another family...

119
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Em dest pêk bînin, te'lîqê we fer bin.
 
Let's start, may your comments be free.

120
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Ere xwişk û birano, ew e derkî em gihan malbatê.
 
Yes, brothers and sisters, here is the place we reached the
family.

121
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:24,000
Mehdî dînese ew resîf. Ev jî yek bilxur.
 
Mehdi, put it on that pavement. This is one bulgur.

122
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:30,000
Xwedê bereketa bavêje. Ev jî tûrikê şekir e.
 
May God throw blessing on it. This is also a bag of sugar.

123
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:35,000
Bese ta mehekê de... taben...
 
It's enough for a month... of course...

124
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:45,000
Min bi perê xwe, perê xwe krî ne... me got sed dolar me bi
perê xwe kirîn.
 
I bought it with my own money, my own money... we said we
bought a hundred dollars with our own money.

125
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Mehdî yek hêlîn jî bîne, sefeteke hêlîn jî bîne... ev jî
teb'en farûc e.
 
Mehdi, bring one carton too, bring a carton of eggs too...
this is also chicken of course.

126
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:55,000
Ev jî birakê kî me ye, ew jî xêrxwaz e, me navê wî zikir
nekiriye.
 
This is also a brother of ours, he is also a benefactor, we
haven't mentioned his name.

127
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Farûc ji xwe ye, riz, bilxur û şekir e...
 
Chicken is for himself, it is rice, bulgur and sugar...

128
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:03,000
Ew jî nika derketiye, we riz kirin, goşt çêkirin...
 
That too is out now, you made rice, you cooked meat...

129
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Xwedê bereketê têxe. Saetê we xweş...
 
May God put blessing in it. Good health to you...

130
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Xwedê qebûl ke, saetên birayê min Mêran xweş, Xwedê qebûl
bike...
 
May God accept it, good health to my brother Meran, may God
accept it...

131
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:17,000
Xwedê di we ra can be, gul û gîşt... û were em herin.
 
May God give you health, flowers and all... and come, let's
go.

132
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:22,000
Erê xwişk û birano ev derke jî teb'en birayê kî me... sê
kursî heye...
 
Yes brothers and sisters, here too of course a brother of
ours... has three wheelchairs...

133
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:25,000
Em ê bidin van malbatan jî...
 
We will give it to these families too...

134
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:28,000
Mehdî ka yek şekir bîne...
 
Mehdi, bring one sugar...

135
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:31,000
Ev e yek şekir, û farûc kî.
 
This is one sugar, and a chicken.

136
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Ew farûc kî û di şûşeyên zeyt. Ka sefeteke hêlîn jî wê
derxîne...
 
That chicken and two bottles of oil. Pull out a carton of
eggs too...

137
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:42,000
Erê wer em pêdin, ha zeyt...
 
Yes come let's give it, here is oil...

138
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Ya Xwedê... ev mal e, mal e... dar ketin...
 
Oh God... this is a family, a family... they went in...

139
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Hemûdê! Te çewa, te çewa?
 
Hamude! How are you, how are you?

140
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:54,000
Milê Hemûdê dar nakeve.
 
Hamude's arm doesn't go in.

141
00:13:54,000 --> 00:14:02,000
Hemûdê... û de were Mehdî. Dîsa we darî Mehdî... yeş. Dîsa
wê ro...
 
Hamude... and come here Mehdi. Put that in again Mehdi...
yes. That again...

142
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:15,000
Hemûdê, merheba! Tu çawa ye... Ev xalo birayê min e Mêran e
te ra şand... Temam?
 
Hamude, hello! How are you... This uncle is my brother
Meran, he sent it for you... Okay?

143
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Ser serê me, ser çavê me, saetê te can be, Xwedê ji te razî
be.
 
Upon our head, upon our eyes, may your health be good, may
God bless you.

144
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:24,000
Erê hevalno ev Hemûdê birayê me ye. Em dar ketin, rûyê wî
nexweş e...
 
Yes friends, this is our brother Hamude. We went in, his
face looks sick...

145
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:26,000
Em nizanin çima ew nexweş e, ew jî ser kursî ye.
 
We don't know why he is sick, he is also in a wheelchair.

146
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,000
Çend salî ye ev kekê te?
 
How old is this brother of yours?

147
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Sî û pênc sal e.
 
He is thirty-five years old.

148
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:38,000
Sî û pênc sal e, li ser kursiyê wî ye. Xwedê emrê wî dirêj
pêde...
 
He is thirty-five years old, he is in his wheelchair. May
God grant him a long life...

149
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:41,000
Min emanetek van gundan girt, ez ê werim bidim we...
 
I took a trust for these villages, I will come and give it
to you...

150
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Fatre fatre ez dewam dikim... Saetên canî we gundî.
 
Period by period I continue... Good health to you villagers.

151
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Û Xwedê bereketê bide, kekê me Mêran silav dikim...
 
And may God give blessing, I greet our brother Meran...

152
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:53,000
Û wextê niha malbatek din heye, ew hol e.
 
And right now there is another family, it's there.

153
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:58,000
Koçer e, aciz e, ser kursîya xwe ye. Em ê herin vê malbatê
jî.
 
He is a nomad, he is tired/sick, he is in his wheelchair. We
will go to this family too.

154
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:04,000
Înşeallah hûn çûn wir, hûn ê dilê însanê şikestî şa bikin.
Xwedê dilê we jî şa bike...
 
God willing you went there, you will make the broken hearts
of people happy. May God make your hearts happy too...

155
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:07,000
Saetê we xweş, bi me ra bin em nika herin vê malbata we...
 
Good health to you, be with us, we will go to your family
now...

156
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:10,000
Erê xwişk û birano vê derê jî em gihan...
 
Yes brothers and sisters, we reached here too...

157
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Ew malbatê cîgir e, mu'aq e.
 
That family is local, disabled.

158
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:22,000
Ew jî ji mêj ve li ser kursî ye... weke şelelê ye.
 
He has also been in a wheelchair for a long time... it's
like paralysis.

159
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Aciz e... em ê... ev malbatê jî teb'en her neqil me dîtin...
 
He is tired/sick... we will... of course we have seen this
family every time...

160
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:32,000
Ew piranî malbatên sêwiyan me vê carê jî me got em mu'aqin
bibînin... û sêwî ne jî.
 
Mostly orphan families, this time too we said let's see the
disabled... and they are orphans too.

161
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:35,000
Kesekî wî tune ye... em ê pê bidinê...
 
He has no one... we will give it to him...

162
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:39,000
Em dibên Xwedê bereketê binvîse. Teb'en ew jî ya...
 
We say may God write a blessing. Of course that too is...

163
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:43,000
Ev e, Mehdî, vê zeytê. Ev jî farûc... ev jî bulxur...
 
This is it, Mehdi, this oil. This is chicken too... this is
bulgur too...

164
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:48,000
Ew çewalê şekir wîne... Em derbasî malbatê bin.
 
Bring that sack of sugar... Let's go to the family.

165
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Ma ne weke zengîniyê, me zengîn pêş... em rûçikên xwe
dernaxin, însan pê nêşin.
 
It's not like wealth, we rich people... we don't show our
faces, so people don't get hurt.

166
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Malyê, malyê em hatin. Bismillahi rahmenî rahîm.
 
Family, family, we came. In the name of God, the most
merciful, the most compassionate.

167
00:15:56,000 --> 00:16:01,000
Teb'en li wir e, ev kursiyê giran e... ew li ser rûdinê
hewa...
 
Of course he is there, this wheelchair is heavy... he sits
on it like this...

168
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:06,000
Em ê deynin vê derê.
 
We will put it here.

169
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Ebo! Merheba... Tu çawa yî?
 
Ebo! Hello... How are you?

170
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:14,000
Te orî derneketiye cewl e baran e wî meneyê na...
 
You haven't gone out today, the weather is rainy, for that
reason right...

171
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:18,000
Heftiyek dibe ez mal de me, nayê we tiştek...
 
It's been a week I'm at home, it's not like that...

172
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:23,000
Heftiyek e dibe ku ez li mal de me, baran e, wê kî te dimîna
dabe...
 
It's been a week that I might be at home, it's raining, who
would have stayed and given you...

173
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:36,000
De we rojê ez mecbûr im we bibînim... ez hatim we bibînim,
em hatin...
 
Well today I have to see you... I came to see you, we
came...

174
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:40,000
Havo birayê Mehran e. Tiştên te re şandiye, ev e.
 
This is brother Mehran. He sent things for you, here it is.

175
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,000
Xwedê xêra wî qebûl bike... saetên te xweş.
 
May God accept his charity... good health to you.

176
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,000
Saetê te jî xweş...
 
Good health to you too...

177
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:50,000
Ev e baskîlêtek giran e. Em dibên Xwedê bereketê bavêje...
 
This is a heavy wheelchair. We say may God throw blessing on
it...

178
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,000
Em naxwazin pir derxin. Xusûsiyeta milet heye, der naxin.
 
We do not want to show too much. There is the privacy of the
people, they don't show.

179
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:55,000
Xaltîka, tu çi duayê ji birayê me Mêran re dikî?
 
Auntie, what prayer do you make for our brother Meran?

180
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:58,000
Saetên wî xweş, Xwedê emrê wî dirêj bike...
 
Good health to him, may God give him a long life...

181
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:05,000
Xwedê ji wî razî be... Xwedê zarokên wî biparêze...
 
May God bless him... May God protect his children...

182
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:11,000
Saetê te jî xweş... Xwedê qebûl bike, Xwedê xêra we
binvîse...
 
Good health to you too... May God accept it, may God write
your charity...

183
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:18,000
Saetên we jî can be, Xwedê ji we razî be, qisûrên me efû
bikin.
 
Good health to you too, may God bless you, forgive our
shortcomings.

184
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:23,000
Em naxwazin milet wera derxîne, hinek hene derxîne...
dîna...
 
We do not want to show the people to you, there are some who
show... looking...

185
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:29,000
Em dernaxin mesela, mecbûr nîn in ku em milet mecbûr bikin
derxînin... min weha navê xwe derxînim...
 
We don't show for example, we are not obliged to force the
people to show... I wouldn't show my name like that...

186
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:34,000
Zane xêr e siba da mezin dibin, tesîrê pê dike... zarok tê
fêhm dike...
 
You know it's charity, tomorrow they grow up, it affects
them... a child understands it...

187
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:40,000
Ev însan feqîr e, mecbûr e ku dozên xwe, derdê xwe derxîne
ser şaşê, maneyê tiştek we ye ev...
 
This person is poor, he is forced to put his case, his pain
on the screen, this is what it means...

188
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:44,000
Em wekî wî nakin. Mecbûr dibin heya em rojekê... me vîdyo
çêkir, me qut kir... em rûçikên wan dernaxin...
 
We don't do like him. They are forced until one day... we
made a video, we cut it... we don't show their faces...

189
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:51,000
Em xilas. Emanetê we gehişt vê malbatê, ev farûcên din jî em
ê...
 
We are done. Your trust reached this family, these other
chickens too we will...

190
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:54,000
Ev ê din jî wekî teyîn e, em ê belav bikin...
 
This other one is as assigned, we will distribute...

191
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:59,000
Teb'en ew nexweş e we xanî e... keşkurek pê xweş e na...
 
Of course he is sick in the house... a wheelchair is good
for him no...

192
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:04,000
Mehdî em vê qîzkê berê vê me sed dolar dayê ye... navê wê
çiye?
 
Mehdi, we gave a hundred dollars to this girl before... what
is her name?

193
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:08,000
Navê wê tiştek we ye... min nexweş dît ev pê dî.
 
Her name is something like that... I saw her sick, give this
to her.

194
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:14,000
Ew jî nexweşek li cem wan jî heye... texmîn dikim we dîtin e
ku qîzika drêj kirî... ew weha nexweş e ma we...
 
There is also a sick person with them... I guess you saw
that the girl is lying down... she is sick like that didn't
you...

195
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,000
Hûn dibin textor?
 
Do you take her to the doctor?

196
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,000
Na li malê ye.
 
No she is at home.

197
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Bes dê sibe bibin na?
 
But you will take her tomorrow right?

198
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:24,000
Xwedê da xêra te...
 
May God grant your charity...

199
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Înşelah xêrxwazek me re ev kir em ê bînin malê... di vî
gundî de...
 
God willing, if a benefactor did this for us we will bring
it to the house... in this village...

200
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:34,000
Çika din nîne... pir hingivîne e...
 
There is not much else... she is very sweet...

201
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:44,000
Saetê we xweş înşelah kesek xêrxwaz we re ev kir em ê
werin... ev e xêra malbatê me re... hêk e. Te farûc e...
 
Good health to you, God willing if a benefactor did this for
you we will come... this is the charity for the family to
us... it is eggs. You have chicken...

202
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:52,000
Pêşî roja ku em wê qîzikê nexweş dît... we dîtin ku li erdê
dirêj kirî bû.
 
The first day we saw that sick girl... you saw that she was
lying on the ground.

203
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:54,000
Pênc salî ye.
 
She is five years old.

204
00:18:54,000 --> 00:19:03,000
Xwedê rehmê pêde. Xwedê sebrê bide we... bavê dinê wir e ne,
em dibînin... Xwedê rehmê bide.
 
May God have mercy on her. May God give you patience... the
father is there too, we see... May God have mercy.

205
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:07,000
Ma ne kesek din nîne... Xwedê binivîse.
 
Is there no one else... May God write it.

206
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:12,000
Ya din... ya din... we re bibe, we re pê bide we re xaltîkê.
Elhemdulah milet bi xwe jî nan dide we...
 
The other... the other... take it for yourself, give it to
yourselves, auntie. Thank God the people themselves give you
food...

207
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Saetê we xweş...
 
Good health to you...

208
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:17,000
Duayê bikin... ji birayê me Mêran re.
 
Pray... for our brother Meran.

209
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:20,000
Saetên wî xweş, Xwedê qebûl bike...
 
Good health to him, may God accept it...

210
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:32,000
Saet xweş, Xwedê rehmê... saet xweş... Xwedê ji we razî
be... saetên xêrxwazan xweş... Ka em herin.
 
Good health, God's mercy... good health... May God bless
you... good health to the benefactors... Come let's go.

211
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:42,000
Erê xwişk û birano. Ev derk e em vîdeoyê xwe tînin dawiyê.
 
Yes brothers and sisters. Here we are bringing our video to
an end.

212
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:47,000
Ev çend malbat em... ev e devî xwe ev me belav kir... ev roj
din.
 
These few families we... this is for their mouths we
distributed this... this other day.

213
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Xwedê qebûl xêra wan hemîyan...
 
May God accept the charity of all of them...

214
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:58,000
Û Xwedê qut û barê ew din kêm neke... Xwedê razî be birayê
me Mêran xêra wan ro dît.. saetên we yên xêrxwaz, di vê
zivistanê we...
 
And may God not reduce their food and provision... May God
be pleased with our brother Meran, he saw their charity
today.. your health benefactors, in this winter of yours...

215
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,000
...we xwe gihandin van malbatan, ev cih anîn... xwece.
 
...you reached these families, brought this place... needs.

216
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
Hun ji bîra min neçin roja îro jî.
 
Don't forget me today either.

217
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,000
Tebî em li gundê Cîbêş bûn, Xoceyê me ra...
 
Of course we were in Cîbêş village, for our Xoce...

218
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:05,000
Xoceyê gundê me.
 
the Xoce of our village.

219
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:08,000
Bila fêde bibe, bila bi xêr be.
 
May it be beneficial, may it be for good.

220
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:11,000
Bila male Xoceyê gund be, Xwedê qebûl ke.
 
May it be the village Xoce's family, may God accept it.

221
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:14,000
Belkî Xwedê dua ji cem we ra bike,
 
Maybe God will make a prayer from you,

222
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:18,000
ji barkiriyê we ra, ji miriyê me û we ra bike, Xwedê qebûl
ke.
 
for your departed ones, for our dead and yours, may God
accept.

223
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:21,000
Tebî camiyê gundê me jî xoce çêkirin e.
 
Of course, the Xoce also built the mosque of our village.

224
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Ha, seke. Wexta camî ava dibû hîç tiştek tunebû, dar û ber
em diçandin jî weha ne.
 
Here, look. When the mosque was built there was nothing, the
trees and things we were planting are like this.

225
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Qor bi qor, belkî weşiyane...
 
Row by row, maybe they have shed...

226
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Seke, ev belkî weşiyane, lê ew her sal tên.
 
Look, these might have shed, but they come every year.

227
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:37,000
Dorê hemû me çandine jî va ne.
 
We planted all around it, here they are.

228
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:41,000
Bes ew gul û tiştan me çandine. Tiştên ku pir kes nizanin.
 
We just planted those roses and things. Things that many
people don't know.

229
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:44,000
Camiyê gund û derdora camiyê hedîdî kirine, dor girtin e.
 
They put iron grilles on the village mosque and its
surroundings, they enclosed it.

230
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,000
Dar, kulîlk wekî vê me diçandin.
 
Trees, flowers like this we used to plant.

231
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:48,000
Bes pir çêbûn. Me çandine qor bi qor...
 
But they turned out great. We planted them row by row...

232
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:50,000
av didin wekî yê din...
 
watering them like the others...

233
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Tebî me da Xoceyê jî, em dibên Xwedê ber qeza û belayê ke.
 
Of course we gave it to the Xoce too, we say may God protect
from accidents and trouble.

234
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:58,000
Û ber destê miriyên we gihîne, saheta birayê min Mêrvan xweş
be.
 
And may it reach the hands of your dead, bless my brother
Mêrvan.

235
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Û saheta xaltîka min jî xweş be, ez çavê gundiyan hemûyan
maç dikim.
 
And bless my aunt too, I kiss the eyes of all the villagers.

236
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,000
Xaltîka min ra temam silavan dikirim, min gotibû navê wê...
 
I send full greetings to my aunt, I had said her name...

237
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:06,000
wate Mêrvan e, ez çavê we jî maç dikim.
 
I mean Mêrvan's, I kiss your eyes too.

238
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Te dît? Saet xweş. Keko were malê...
 
Did you see? Bless you. Brother, come to the house...

239
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,000
Erê, erê, saet we xweş be.
 
Yes, yes, bless you.

240
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,000
Ew navê... Bêrîvana qîza wan...
 
That name... Bêrîvan, their daughter...

241
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Erê, erê, Xwedê xêr ke. Xwedê li ber qeza û belayê ke.
 
